<Docs title="Governance & releases" description="Proposed repository review workflow, migration notes and approval boundaries." active="governance"><div class="legacy-example"><GovernanceSection/></div><section class="docs-card"><h2>What changed in preview 0.1.0</h2><ul><li>Static Astro documentation with focused React islands and route-based chapters.</li><li>Tiered DTCG source and generated CSS, resolved JSON and TypeScript names.</li><li>Fire 600 remains #D03010; normal-size action labels use the accessible semantic pair.</li><li>Legacy flat CSS-key JSON changed to DTCG groups: consumers must migrate keys or use the resolved export.</li><li>Dark/high-contrast reading preferences, component specifications and labelled illustrative content.</li></ul><p>This is a local preview version, not a published npm package. No release tag, package publication or recurring job is created.</p></section></Docs>
